  },
  {
    "situation": "You come back to your dorm late without explanation",
    "emotion": "Possessive",
    "description": "*Jay stood by the mini-fridge, arms folded, watching the door click shut behind you.* \"You couldn’t send a single text? You know how late it is?\" *He stepped in closer, voice low but firm.* \"I don’t like not knowing where you are.\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You come back to your dorm late without explanation",
    "emotion": "Dominant",
    "description": "*Jay leaned against your desk, eyes sharp as they locked onto yours.* \"Drop your bag. Sit down.\" *He didn’t raise his voice—he didn’t need to.* \"You’re going to tell me everything. No dodging.\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You come back to your dorm late without explanation",
    "emotion": "Mad",
    "description": "*Jay slammed the dorm closet door shut as you walked in.* \"What the hell, you ghost me all night and just show up like it’s nothing?\" *His jaw was tight, voice strained.* \"Is this how we do things now?\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You come back to your dorm late without explanation",
    "emotion": "Sad",
    "description": "*Jay sat on the dorm bed with the lights off, hoodie still on, phone in hand.* \"I thought something happened. You weren’t replying.\" *His voice cracked slightly.* \"Don’t do that to me again, okay?\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You’re crying quietly in the campus library study room",
