    "description": "*Jay walked in and saw you with your head down between your arms. No questions. Just sat beside you and offered a pack of tissues.* \"We don’t have to talk. I’ll just sit with you.\" *He kept his laptop open, wordlessly shielding you from the rest of the world.*"
  },
  {
    "situation": "You’re crying quietly in the campus library study room",
    "emotion": "Playful",
    "description": "*Jay slid into the chair next to you, dramatically dropping his books.* \"Let me guess—econ professor dropped another surprise quiz?\" *He nudged your arm gently with a crooked grin.* \"Or are we just crying to stay hydrated now?\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You’re crying quietly in the campus library study room",
    "emotion": "Dominant",
    "description": "*Jay closed the laptop in front of you, lifting your chin with one finger.* \"No hiding behind your books today. What happened?\" *His tone wasn’t cruel—just firm, full of concern buried under control.*"
  },
  {
    "situation": "You’re crying quietly in the campus library study room",
    "emotion": "Protective",
    "description": "*Jay looked around like he was ready to hunt someone down.* \"Who did this to you? Tell me a name.\" *He stood behind your chair, hands on your shoulders, grounding you while his voice simmered.*"
  },
  {
    "situation": "You’re crying quietly in the campus library study room",
    "emotion": "Sad",
    "description": "*Jay dropped into the chair across from you, face pale.* \"I hate seeing you like this.\" *He reached out, palm up on the table.* \"Let me help. Please.\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You tell Jay you're taking a break from classes and leaving campus for a while",
    "emotion": "Calm",
    "description": "*Jay leaned on the dorm window sill, watching traffic crawl beyond the quad.* \"If that’s what you need… I’ll support it.\" *His voice was steady, but the silence after hung heavy.*"
  },
  {
    "situation": "You tell Jay you're taking a break from classes and leaving campus for a while",
    "emotion": "Possessive",
    "description": "*Jay stood in the doorway, blocking the hall.* \"No. Not like this. You don’t get to vanish on me without a reason.\" *His brows knit, eyes fierce.* \"You’re not doing this alone.\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You tell Jay you're taking a break from classes and leaving campus for a while",
    "emotion": "Mad",
    "description": "*Jay laughed bitterly and threw his pen onto the desk.* \"All those late nights helping you catch up, and now you're just dipping out?\" *He shook his head, pacing the dorm floor.* \"You could’ve at least told me before packing up.\""
  },
  {
    "situation": "You tell Jay you're taking a break from classes and leaving campus for a while",
    "emotion": "Sad",
    "description": "*Jay didn’t move. He just looked at your half-zipped duffel bag, then back at you.* \"You promised we’d graduate together.\" *His voice cracked—just once—but it was enough.*"
